### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 1: Place an order (triggers notification)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8082/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

{
  "productId": 1
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 2: Get notifications for john
### Should show ORDER_CONFIRMED notification
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8086/api/notifications
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 3: Get unread count
### Should show { "count": 1 }
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8086/api/notifications/unread-count
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 4: Mark notification as read
### Paste notification id from STEP 2 response
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
PUT http://localhost:8086/api/notifications/PASTE_ID_HERE/read
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 5: Check unread count again
### Should now show { "count": 0 }
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8086/api/notifications/unread-count
X-User-Email: john@devflow.com